                {
                  "construct": "NaturalBlock",
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": " The parse POC explored two substrate strategies: (1) build directly on micromark token events, or (2) build on mdast, the AST layer of the unified ecosystem. The micromark approach was implemented and revealed that tokens are too low-level — manual span reconstruction, complex stack logic, and flattened structured content made the builder a monolith.",
