                },
                {
                  "construct": "NaturalBlock",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "value": "mdast sits between micromark (syntax) and remark (pipeline). It provides a tree of typed nodes (`heading`, `strong`, `list`, `paragraph`, etc.) with children, positions, and inline content already reconstructed. This is exactly the layer where art's construct classification belongs.",
